# photos, recordings and panel logs from the lab
# recorded robot data: point clouds and camera frames are large and get
# re-collected rather than read in a diff. The session reports are the
# exception - a lab run with no internet is only worth recording if the
# record can be brought back, so those go in.
lab/data/*
!lab/data/sessions/
lab/data/sessions/*
!lab/data/sessions/report_*.md
!lab/data/sessions/session_*.jsonl

# the browser's own self-report: regenerated every time a page loads
web/clientlog.json
